{0 Workflows}

How to start, build, configure and deploy an Eliom project.

- {{!//workflow/page-distillery}Distillery}: create a project from a
  template, then build and run it.
- {{!//workflow/page-mobile}Mobile apps}: one code base for a Web application
  and Android or iOS apps.
- {{!//workflow/page-configuration}Configuration & running}: Eliom's options
  in the Ocsigen Server configuration file, and options for your own modules.
- {{!//workflow/page-scalability}Scalability}: running an application on
  several cores or servers.
